{"id":"5095","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5095_main_cirrocumulus-with-undulatus-and-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>该图像主要显示了卷积云，是根据其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常小的元素</span>，表观宽度小于1°而确定的。 可以看到两个云种：起伏确定了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波状云</span>云种，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的小孔</span>看起来像一个网，可将其确定为网状云。右下角是一片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">成层卷积层</span>的边缘，而左边则是一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国巴特克罗伊茨纳赫县","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"07 December 2015 1424 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5095_syn_cirrocumulus-with-undulatus-and-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC的天气图显示了德国的大部都处在温区条件下，午后气温超过10°C。在暖空气中，一些高层和中层云在对流层上层发展，其与较弱的短波槽相关联。 </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5095_sat_cirrocumulus-with-undulatus-and-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>卫星图像显示一道暖锋从冰岛向北海延伸，一直延伸到德国北部，而一道冷锋则从冰岛延伸到西班牙西北部。德国大部都处于暖区内，高层和中层云在对流层上层发展，其与较弱的短波槽相关联。在比荷卢和德国西部可以看到一片云，在50平行线附近向东延伸。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5103_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图像显示的是在一个晴朗的日子，天顶处的卷积云。云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色，没有阴影</span>，由小元素组成。它具有整体透镜形状，说明是荚状云类，具有相当漫射的边缘。可以在图像的顶部详细地看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">具有小尺度蜂窝结构的网状云类</span>。可代表气流的探测表明云高约7000米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰萨翁林纳","latitude":"纬度: 61° 52' 8'' N","longitude":"经度: 28° 53' 24'' E","date":"27 July 2008 0644 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5104_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这个放大的图像是一部分卷积云。它图解说明了网状云云类的典型结构，具有或多或少规则分布的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆孔，如网状或蜂窝状</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰萨翁林纳","latitude":"纬度: 61° 52' 14'' N","longitude":"经度: 28° 53' 28'' E","date":"27 July 2008 0645 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.6"}]}]}